intro = Torin: "The Deepstone vault lies at the foot of this mountain. The dwarves of Deldrimor sealed something inside... let's go down."
kay = Kay: "Mind the ledges. And the bats."
checkpoint = Checkpoint reached.
hall.enter = Torin: "The crystal chamber. The crystal needs two orbs of light: one to the west, one to the east."
grid.intro = A rune grid: don't touch the lit green tiles. At the end, two runes to press together.
grid.runes = Stand on both runes at once to open the barrier (alone: run from one to the other within {seconds} s).
grid.hit = The runes burn you!
rune.one = A rune lights up... the other must be pressed at the same time.
grid.solved = Both runes light up: the grid goes dark and the barrier opens.
sentinel.enter = The Deepstone Sentinel rises at the edge of the void.
sentinel.spiral = The Sentinel unleashes a wind spiral: stay under it!
sentinel.sprites = Wind sprites rise: break them before they carry someone into the void!
sprite.caught = A wind sprite carries you to the edge!
sprite.broken = The wind sprite dissipates.
sprite.thrown = The wind sprite hurls you into the void!
sentinel.reset = The Sentinel melts into the wind.
sentinel.victory = The Sentinel collapses: an orb of light remains on the ledge.
nest.down = The nest bursts.
bridge.intro = Wind sweeps the bridge: leave the red strips. Two runes in the middle stop it.
bridge.blown = The wind carries you away!
bridge.fall = Back to the start of the bridge.
bridge.solved = Both runes light up: the wind dies down and the barrier at the end opens.
queen.mothers = Two brood mothers guard the Queen's den.
queen.enter = The Brood Queen emerges from the dark!
queen.protect = The Queen shields herself and calls her brood!
queen.reset = The brood withdraws into the dark.
queen.victory = The Brood Queen collapses: an orb of light remains in her den.
orb.taken = {name} brings an orb of light to the crystal.
orb.carry = Place the orb in the crystal, behind you.
crystal.empty = The crystal awaits an orb of light.
crystal.one = The crystal half lights up. It needs a second one.
crystal.full = The crystal blazes: the Light of Deldrimor is yours! Right click to release it.
light.cooldown = The Light of Deldrimor is recharging.
treasure.found = The Light reveals a dwarven treasure!
minotaur.enter = A shadow Minotaur appears, veiled: only the Light of Deldrimor makes it vulnerable.
minotaur.revealed = The Light dispels the Minotaur's veil!
minotaur.imps = The Minotaur calls the shadows!
minotaur.reset = The Minotaur melts into the shadows.
minotaur.victory = The Minotaur dissipates: the north door opens.
pit.intro = The abyss chamber: the path reveals itself to the Light of Deldrimor. Light the four orbs.
pit.orb = An orb lights up ({count}/{total}).
pit.dark = The path fades into shadow: get close to the last tile and release the Light.
pit.flame = A spectral flame dooms a tile: the Light saves it.
pit.fall = Back to the last lit orb.
pit.done = All four orbs shine: the way out appears.
lift.intro = Everyone on the platform: it will go down.
lift.start = The platform starts moving.
lift.wave = Shadows attack the lift!
lift.elite = A bloodsucker leads the second wave!
lift.resume = The platform resumes its descent.
lift.bottom = The bottom of the vault. A corridor leads to the arena.
lift.rune = The rune takes you back to the platform.
voice.enter = Torin: "It... it speaks to me." The shadows consume Torin: the Voice!
voice.updraft = Residual Updraft: a fall will be forgiven ({count}).
voice.saved = The updraft lifts you back up!
voice.bomb = A shadow bomb latches onto you!
voice.siphon = The Voice siphons your spirits: break its defiance!
voice.siphon.broken = The siphon is broken: the Voice staggers!
voice.shades = Shades crawl over the tiles!
voice.split = The Voice withdraws into the shadows: destroy the spectral flames before they reach it!
voice.absorb = A flame reaches the Voice: blast!
voice.back = The Voice is vulnerable again.
voice.teleport = The Voice shifts through the shadows.
voice.reset = The Voice falls silent... for now.
voice.victory = The Voice falls silent: Torin collapses, freed. Deepstone's treasure is yours.
title.victory = Deepstone complete
